    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push &amp; Plunder is an <strong>Action-Packed Arcade Wave Survival</strong> game where <strong>every shot counts!</strong>\u00a0Harness physics-based coin shots to decimate the mighty bauble horde in chaotic, chain-reaction combat. Upgrade your abilities, unlock permanent power-ups, and create powerful builds to overcome waves of increasingly challenging enemies. Can you survive and bring an end to the bauble uprising?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111550/extras/c282bc99a8fc582ac1907e6cdba3a4f1.poster.avif?t=1754590717\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111550/extras/c282bc99a8fc582ac1907e6cdba3a4f1.webm?t=1754590717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111550/extras/c282bc99a8fc582ac1907e6cdba3a4f1.mp4?t=1754590717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs that last about half an hour (depending on how well you did!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90 Challenges to complete that reward you with...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable perks, equipment, and classes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create unique Builds every run! </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push &amp; Plunder is an <strong>Action-Packed Arcade Wave Survival</strong> game where <strong>every shot counts!</strong>\u00a0Harness physics-based coin shots to decimate the mighty bauble horde in chaotic, chain-reaction combat. Upgrade your abilities, unlock permanent power-ups, and create powerful builds to overcome waves of increasingly challenging enemies. Can you survive and bring an end to the bauble uprising?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111550/extras/c282bc99a8fc582ac1907e6cdba3a4f1.poster.avif?t=1754590717\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111550/extras/c282bc99a8fc582ac1907e6cdba3a4f1.webm?t=1754590717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111550/extras/c282bc99a8fc582ac1907e6cdba3a4f1.mp4?t=1754590717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs that last about half an hour (depending on how well you did!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 90 Challenges to complete that reward you with...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable perks, equipment, and classes! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create unique Builds every run! </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An Arcade game where you fire coins at evil statues that hurt you if they fall off the bottom of the board. Complete Challenges, unlock classes, perks, and equipment for your next attempts. Earn Gems &amp; Coins in runs to buy permanent upgrades and unlocks. Can you survive 'til the end?",
